.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-MOUSE 1
.Os 1.6.2

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-mouse
.Nd configure mouse and pointer settings.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
It adjusts:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Pointer sensitivity, acceleration and acceleration threshold.
.It
Left-handed button mapping, which swaps the primary and secondary buttons.
.It
Double-click interval.
.It
Number of lines scrolled per mouse wheel step.
.El
.Pp
Pointer acceleration, threshold and button mapping are applied immediately
to the X server.
Double-click interval and wheel scroll lines are written to the Qt settings
and apply to Qt applications started afterwards.
.Pp
.Nm
requires an X11 session.
Under any other display server it saves its settings but does not apply the
pointer changes.

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-mouse
.It Pa ~/.config/lumina-desktop/lcc-mouse.conf
Saved settings for this utility.
.It Pa ~/.config/Trolltech.conf
Qt double-click interval and wheel scroll lines.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr xset 1

